@host = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Readiness
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### Valid transaction (200)
POST {{host}}/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{"transactionId":"TXN-1","accountId":"ACC123456","amount":250,"currency":"SGD","merchantCategory":"RETAIL"}

### Rejected transaction (422)
POST {{host}}/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{"transactionId":"TXN-2","accountId":"ACC123456","amount":50000,"currency":"JPY","merchantCategory":"GAMBLING"}

### Prometheus metrics
GET {{host}}/metrics
